OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans flats plan approved after
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA block of flats for former soldiers in
OL,7,FEastwood which faced delays is set to
OL,8,Fbe built after plans were approved.
OL,10,FBroxtowe Borough Council purchased the
OL,11,Fempty parcel of land off Cross Street
OL,12,Fin Hill Top in October 2024.
OL,14,FOriginally, it had been hoped the block
OL,15,Fwould feature eight flats; however, the
OL,16,Fscheme has since been revised to six
OL,17,Fone- and two-bedroom flats to better
OL,18,Fmeet national living space standards.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
