OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans flats plan approved after
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week, the council-run project for
OL,7,Fveterans who were either homeless, at
OL,8,Frisk of homelessness or in
OL,9,Finappropriate accommodation, was
OL,10,Funanimously approved at a planning
OL,11,Fcommittee meeting but no timetable was
OL,12,Fgiven.
